Version 0.99.0 (2023-02-22)
+ Submitted to Bioconductor
Version 1.3.2
+ Updated tool to revised manuscript
+ New phasing approaches via predefined haploblocks and allelic imbalance
+ Confidence measurement for each gene status 
Version 1.3.5
+ fixed small issues in tool and documentation
Version 1.13.0
+ Compatibility with GenomicAlignments >= 1.49.1, in which
  cigarRangesAlongQuerySpace() and cigarRangesAlongReferenceSpace() are
  defunct and replaced by the cigarillo package functions
  cigars_as_ranges_along_query() and cigars_as_ranges_along_ref()
Version 1.13.1
+ Optimized haplotype phasing runtime by caching per-gene parsed reads and
  read-by-variant evidence, reducing repeated CIGAR parsing across variant
  combinations
+ Reduced repeated row-binding in direct and indirect phasing loops
+ Made distance matrix construction cutoff-aware for dense variant sets
